    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but if the choice is a wash, then there's no logical reason to pick the harder option. if life is just a series of struggles that lead to nothing, choosing to leave isn't \"bad\" or \"wrong,\" it's just choosing the path with the least resistance. isn't that just being efficient? if there's no objective value to staying, then exiting is just as valid as staying.",
